    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Left low back pain and spasm; no other joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No leg numbness, weakness or saddle numbness; no further seizures</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No difficulty passing urine, retention or incontinence</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bowel incontinence or constipation; no stomach pain</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills or weight loss</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
